OL,3,GNEWSAHow are water companies performing
OL,4,Ain the South East?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo water companies in the South East
OL,7,Fhave poor performance on the
OL,8,Fenvironment while the third, South East
OL,9,FWater, is the worst in the industry for
OL,10,Fsupply interruptions, a new report
OL,11,Fsays.
OL,13,FA new report from joint water
OL,14,Fregulators Ofwat, the Drinking Water
OL,15,FInspectorate, the Environment Agency,
OL,16,Fand National Resources Wales, has been
OL,17,Freleased to give a single view on
OL,18,Fperformance.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
